Rebrand legacy .properties brand strings from Nightly to Vela and Pyxis Vela.

════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
The unified diff below is generated from the checkout and is applied with
  git apply gecko/patches/pyxis/<path>.PYXIS_DIFF
(or `patch -p1 <`). Everything above this line is rationale, not content;
git apply ignores it. Regenerate with scripts/regen-gecko-patches.sh.
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

diff --git a/browser/branding/unofficial/locales/en-US/brand.properties b/browser/branding/unofficial/locales/en-US/brand.properties
index 346c3bdb509b..0783438e3bcb 100644
--- a/browser/branding/unofficial/locales/en-US/brand.properties
+++ b/browser/branding/unofficial/locales/en-US/brand.properties
@@ -2,6 +2,6 @@
 # License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not distributed with this
 # file, You can obtain one at http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.
 
-brandShorterName=Nightly
-brandShortName=Nightly
-brandFullName=Nightly
+brandShorterName=Vela
+brandShortName=Vela
+brandFullName=Pyxis Vela
